Subject: [PATCH] Copy 10-bit swapchain images into 8-bit drawables for Steam's
 overlay.

Steam's overlay for macOS games draws into the drawable as if it had 8
bits per channel and garbles 10-bit ones. With the overlay loaded, a
swapchain in RGB10A2 or BGR10A2 renders to textures of its own format,
and each present copies one into a BGRA8 drawable. Swapchains also log
their extent and format.
---
